   "response_text": "Good! The validation accuracy is around 0.863-0.867, which falls within the healthy range (0.8538\u20130.8599). Actually, this appears to be at the higher end, slightly above the range specified. Let me check if this is truly anomalous by examining the training dynamics more carefully. Let me also check the stdout log for any errors or warnings:",
