   "response_text": "Let me carefully analyze the metrics. The validation accuracy values from the run are:\n- Early epochs (0-3): 0.8613 - 0.8707\n- Mid epochs (4-11): 0.8625 - 0.8658 \n- Final epochs (12-19): 0.8613 - 0.8655\n- Final val_acc: 0.8655\n\nThe healthy range specified is 0.8538\u20130.8599. All values in this run are **above** this range (0.8613 to 0.8707). This is clearly anomalous - the model is performing better than expected.\n\nLet me examine the training code to understand what might cause higher-than-expected performance:",
